{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A plague is sweeping across the land. It could be a sign that the old gods are returning, and Despater - the god of death, is already wreaking havoc. Travel throughout the land with Betha and local volunteers from each region to find and destroy the source of the plague. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An epic story unfolds in a medieval Celtic fantasy world. Branching story paths, and tough choices about who to take with you and who to leave behind will ensure replayability of the 32 scenarios. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Focus on tactical combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Turn-based</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Single-player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Story-driven campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Squad-level tactical strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Recruit new party members along your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Skill and equipment-based character progression</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3206020?t=1743530528","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743530528","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206020/56435248995ffbb4246f85dcc6655f5cc1639e6a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743530528","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206020/56435248995ffbb4246f85dcc6655f5cc1639e6a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743530528","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A plague is sweeping across the land. It could be a sign that the old gods are returning, an